Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.95,0:00:02.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wonder how long it's\Ngonna take the rest of them.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:03.04,0:00:04.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}This is boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.79,0:00:09.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:10.67,0:00:12.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where did it go?!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:13.01,0:00:16.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh, Gedatsu, your eyes\Nare rolled all the way
Dialogue: 50,0:00:16.22,0:00:17.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,into the back of your head.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:17.72,0:00:20.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Honestly, how could you expect\Nto see anything like that?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:21.13,0:00:22.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So careless!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.80,0:00:26.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, how's your vision?\NCan you see this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.72,0:00:29.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here it is, that puny creature.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:30.18,0:00:32.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's one of those\NBlue Sea dwellers.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:32.36,0:00:33.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:34.03,0:00:36.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just thought\Nit was a raccoon dog.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:36.35,0:00:37.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DIVINE E]\NRacoon dog?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:37.62,0:00:39.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No. He's nothing like\Na wild animal.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:39.64,0:00:40.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He walks upright.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:40.69,0:00:42.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That is unquestionably\Na creature
Dialogue: 50,0:00:42.37,0:00:44.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that comes from the Blue Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:45.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:45.94,0:00:48.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where are you hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.58,0:00:49.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:50.39,0:00:51.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.76,0:00:54.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, this is getting lame!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:54.35,0:00:57.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Awww. Where is everybody?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:57.60,0:01:00.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is where\Nwe're supposed to meet!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:00.65,0:01:01.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.82,0:01:03.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,C'mon, I'm lonely,
Dialogue: 50,0:01:03.23,0:01:06.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and I'm getting a\Nlittle freaked out here!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:13.08,0:01:15.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GEDATSU]\NWhere'd you go?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:24.45,0:01:27.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come out right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.12,0:03:42.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[WYPER]\NWhere are you, Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.36,0:03:44.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER]\NI'll find you!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.61,0:03:47.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know you're still alive!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.19,0:03:48.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:48.48,0:03:51.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I plan on stayin' that way!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.85,0:04:06.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the heck is goin' on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.11,0:04:15.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER]\NWhat is that?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.54,0:04:23.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER]\NWhere could\Nthat kid have run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.58,0:04:26.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[rumbling]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.66,0:04:28.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER]\NStrange.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:28.26,0:04:29.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No matter.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.51,0:04:31.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't be wasting\Nmy energy on him anyhow.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.80,0:04:34.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have a more important battle.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.33,0:04:37.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All of my strength\Nneeds to be saved
Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.21,0:04:39.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,if I'm going to win\Nmy fight with Eneru.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.00,0:04:40.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I'm certain,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.04,0:04:42.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,if I use the\Nreject one more time,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.75,0:04:47.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,my body will be reduced\Nto a pile of ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.30,0:04:50.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the end of the line, Eneru!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.15,0:05:10.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP cries]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.57,0:05:12.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What have you done?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.95,0:05:16.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You... You killed our Sanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.12,0:05:18.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NIt's useless.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.62,0:05:19.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No pulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.96,0:05:23.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wish Chopper were here.\NHe'd know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.23,0:05:28.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Sanji, Sanji. Sanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.49,0:05:30.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It wasn't supposed\Nto be this way!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.07,0:05:32.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Usopp!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.83,0:05:34.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your checking his\Nright side for a heartbeat.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.00,0:05:37.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The left side is\Nwhere his heart is!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.73,0:05:39.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[beating heart]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:39.89,0:05:40.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[shrieks]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.73,0:05:42.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's alive!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:43.66,0:05:44.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Back from the dead.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:45.08,0:05:47.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.16,0:05:49.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But he's still not well,\Njust look at him.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.83,0:05:50.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.00,0:05:52.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't die again!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:52.38,0:05:54.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I need you here!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.27,0:05:58.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! You!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.40,0:05:59.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know\Nwhat you did to him,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.77,0:06:02.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but you better not try\Nany more monkey business!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.49,0:06:07.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP squeaks]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.33,0:06:14.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.72,0:06:19.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You will stay quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.22,0:06:21.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Or join your friends.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.45,0:06:24.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NAm I being clear?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:26.32,0:06:27.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.62,0:06:29.20,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NWho is this guy?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.78,0:06:31.99,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,And how did he do that?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.07,0:06:33.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you want, Eneru?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.61,0:06:37.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What wicked reason could you\Npossibly have for coming aboard?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.28,0:06:39.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NDuring the six years\NI've been on this island,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.64,0:06:42.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've kept your former\Nsubordinates very busy.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.69,0:06:45.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They've been slaving away\Nfor me all these long years,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.61,0:06:48.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and they've hardly\Nhad a moment to rest.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.11,0:06:53.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My Divine Warriors\Nhave been reduced to slaves.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.73,0:06:56.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They are most extraordinary.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.44,0:06:59.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Truly they are of great talent.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.15,0:07:02.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But it appears that their\Nyears of hard labor are over.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.28,0:07:05.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You see, this island\Nis no longer useful to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.89,0:07:08.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Consequently, I no longer\Nrequire the services
Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.37,0:07:11.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of your former Divine Warriors.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.33,0:07:14.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you suspect that I have\Nsinister motives in coming here,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.73,0:07:17.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but I have simply come\Nto bid you farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.19,0:07:19.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That is all.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:20.74,0:07:23.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NI will say this,\Nsometimes I envy
Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.53,0:07:27.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the blissfull, innocent\Nstupidity of Skypiea's people.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.58,0:07:30.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The fools here can only see\Nthis island as nothing more
Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.25,0:07:32.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,than a clump of\Nvearth in the sky.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.00,0:07:34.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL]\NWhat are you talking about?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.68,0:07:36.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stupid old man.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.18,0:07:38.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All these years you never\Nguessed the true reason
Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.58,0:07:40.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we seized this island?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.85,0:07:43.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The reason that the Blue Sea\Nflies are here meddling
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.31,0:07:45.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in the islands affairs.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.56,0:07:48.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And the reason the Shandorians\Nfight so bravely to return
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.36,0:07:51.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to their sacred homeland?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.06,0:07:56.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You see, all this is happening\Nfor one purpose and one alone.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.61,0:08:00.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There is something here\Nthat they all seek.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.87,0:08:03.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NThe great treasures of Shandora,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.16,0:08:04.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the legendary city of gold
Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.75,0:08:07.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that prospered on the\NBlue Sea so long ago!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.04,0:08:11.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gold is what brings us all here!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.11,0:08:14.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is gold?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.65,0:08:17.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And why is it\Nso important to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.41,0:08:19.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.62,0:08:22.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your ignorance never\Nceases to amaze!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:22.37,0:08:24.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The only people in the world\Nwho know nothing of gold
Dialogue: 50,0:08:24.77,0:08:27.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,or it's value live in the\Nmidst of an untold fortune!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.03,0:08:29.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You didn't even know\Nwhat the goal was,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.81,0:08:32.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so how could you\Nhave won this game?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.19,0:08:35.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Interstingly enough, our game of\Nsurvival is in it's final play.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:36.03,0:08:37.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoever wins, gets the gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.99,0:08:41.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.03,0:08:43.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can you hear it now?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.50,0:08:46.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The sounds of our\Nlively little competition?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.17,0:08:54.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NAs a matter of fact,\NI'm a contestant myself,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:54.27,0:08:57.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so I must be off.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.13,0:09:00.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait, Eneru.\NThe Divine Warriors.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.36,0:09:03.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you going to set them free?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.91,0:09:05.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NGod only knows.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.91,0:09:08.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And he's not telling.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.66,0:09:10.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL]\NEneru, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.86,0:09:12.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.44,0:09:16.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP coughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.24,0:09:19.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NUsopp! You're still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.87,0:09:28.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Make way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.01,0:09:36.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Another one?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.00,0:09:44.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENBOU]\NHmph. These\Nweaklings aren't worth my time!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.90,0:09:52.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YAMA]\NWhat exquisite\Nammunition you have there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.26,0:09:57.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Matter that dense does not\Nnaturally exist here in the sky.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.47,0:10:02.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YAMA]\NThe vearth mineral\Ncalled iron, isn't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.27,0:10:08.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YAMA]\NYou have managed to\Nmake quick work of my men,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.86,0:10:11.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,which is a difficult task\Nto say the least.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.61,0:10:13.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My guess...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.11,0:10:17.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...is that you are the great\NShandorian warrior, Genbou.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.03,0:10:20.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Commander Yama, good guess!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.68,0:10:24.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.50,0:10:36.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.51,0:10:49.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENBOU]\NNo!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.73,0:10:52.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I refuse to die!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.69,0:10:57.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not like this. Not here.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.40,0:11:01.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YAMA]\NAh! Still alive I see!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.78,0:11:04.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You are tough!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.24,0:11:08.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Very well, as a gesture of\Nrespect for your warrior spirit.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.15,0:11:13.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will end your suffering\Nwith my secret technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.46,0:11:21.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[GENBOU]\NTen Axe Attack!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.66,0:11:25.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Yama!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.65,0:11:31.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[YAMA]\NAxe Mountain!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.09,0:11:50.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So very close, yet,\Nso very far away.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.84,0:11:55.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.64,0:11:56.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HOTORI]\NHa-haaa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.06,0:11:59.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KOTORI]\NHaa-ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.99,0:12:01.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NWho are you guys?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.18,0:12:04.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HOTORI]\NThat's a stupid question!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.31,0:12:06.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[HOTORI, KOTORI]\N– We're Deputy Divine Commanders!\N– We're Deputy Divine Commanders!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.07,0:12:08.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KOTORI]\NYou killed our brother Satori!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.89,0:12:10.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HOTORI]\NNow you're gonna pay!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.66,0:12:11.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Brother?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.36,0:12:12.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.85,0:12:14.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I haven't killed anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.98,0:12:17.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[HOTORI, KOTORI]\N– Ha-haha. Ha-ha!\N– Ha-haha. Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.40,0:12:21.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha! You can call me Hotori!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.28,0:12:24.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha! And you can call me Kotori!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.58,0:12:27.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And you guys killed our\Nbeloved big brother, Satori.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.79,0:12:29.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.54,0:12:32.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry to bust your bubble,\Nbut I don't know your bother.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.08,0:12:34.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, you're all gonna pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.19,0:12:36.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pierre!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.05,0:12:43.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We must deal\Nwith these two quickly
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.72,0:12:45.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and return to\Nthe business at hand.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.80,0:12:47.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We need to find Eneru
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.39,0:12:50.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and rescue my Divine Warriors\Nbefore the unthinkable happens.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.72,0:13:02.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, stand back, young lady!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.97,0:13:06.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I may be injured, but I'd never\Nlose to the likes of those two!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.07,0:13:09.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No. I won't stand\Nback this time.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.97,0:13:11.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,'Cause sometimes I'm the one...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:11.18,0:13:14.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...who has to\Nprotect my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.07,0:13:18.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Very well then.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.90,0:13:21.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,First we need to determine\Nwhich dials they possess.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.82,0:13:23.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.66,0:13:26.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Time to avenge our brother!\NTime to avenge our brother!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.99,0:13:28.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.60,0:13:56.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NA memorial to the city itself.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.53,0:14:03.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Its descendants built it.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.45,0:14:05.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After the great city fell.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.74,0:14:08.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NShandora.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.75,0:14:11.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was the name\Nof this ancient place.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.01,0:14:19.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\N402 S.E.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.22,0:14:22.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The city, was at its\Npeak 11 hundred years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.58,0:14:26.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But then it toppled\Naround 800 years ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.26,0:14:31.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That time frame\Nalmost perfectly matches
Dialogue: 50,0:14:31.58,0:14:33.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the hundred years\Nof history that vanished
Dialogue: 50,0:14:33.24,0:14:35.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,from the rest of the world.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.29,0:14:37.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Perhaps this\Nisland holds the key.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.04,0:14:41.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The key to a\Nlong-forgotten history,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.69,0:14:43.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that was veiled\Nfrom the world below.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.03,0:14:48.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NThis is a complete\Nmap of Shandora.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.23,0:14:50.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I'll learn more\Nabout this "Blank Century"
Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.69,0:14:53.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,if I go to the\Ncenter of the city.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.45,0:14:56.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.62,0:14:59.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't you a\Nbeautiful young lady?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.68,0:15:09.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where did you go?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.10,0:15:14.64,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[GEDATSU]\NA concealment\Ntechnique no doubt.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.12,0:15:17.46,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NHis eyes\Nare rolled back in his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.54,0:15:20.50,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,And it's really spooky!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.96,0:15:26.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gedatsu, you can't see the enemy
Dialogue: 50,0:15:26.59,0:15:28.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with your eyes\Nrolled back like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.01,0:15:29.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.08,0:15:31.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So careless!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.93,0:15:33.85,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NWhat a dimwit!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.14,0:15:35.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NAn enemy huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.06,0:15:37.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it now.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.29,0:15:39.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You must be one Eneru's priests.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.47,0:15:46.72,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[GEDATSU]\NIndeed, I am.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.80,0:15:49.43,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Let me introduce myself.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.51,0:15:53.77,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,My name is Gedatsu, priest in\Nthe service of Almighty Eneru.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.85,0:15:55.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.23,0:15:56.89,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[GEDATSU]\NAnd I command the Upper Yard's
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.01,0:15:59.05,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Ordeal of the Swamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.14,0:16:00.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.18,0:16:02.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,C'mon, say something you jerk!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.78,0:16:05.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DIVINE BAA]\NGedatsu, he can't hear you
Dialogue: 50,0:16:05.28,0:16:07.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,unless you start\Nspeaking out loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.82,0:16:09.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So careless!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:09.08,0:16:11.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't normally forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.29,0:16:12.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GEDATSU]\NHmph!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.29,0:16:17.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I advise you to watch\Nwhere you step.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.50,0:16:18.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.71,0:16:21.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This entire area is\Nmy territory to control!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.59,0:16:23.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All around us are swamp clouds.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.51,0:16:25.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And once you find\Nyourself trapped by one
Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.43,0:16:27.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,there is no hope of escape.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.35,0:16:29.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The survival rate\Nhere is 50 percent.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:30.02,0:16:31.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's almost tragic.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.80,0:16:34.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ordeal of the Swamp!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:34.14,0:16:35.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"The swamp"?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.30,0:16:36.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Best of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.58,0:16:39.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're sinking!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:39.75,0:16:42.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fool! It has no effect on me!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.34,0:16:43.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Swamp cloud.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.37,0:16:47.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[GEDATSU]\NMilky dial!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.13,0:16:55.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:16:55.64,0:16:57.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.61,0:16:59.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NHe's shooting\Nsomething out his feet
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.00,0:17:02.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that makes him fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.67,0:17:06.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's so cool!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.76,0:17:11.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Something's coming\Nout of his hands.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.62,0:17:13.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GEDATSU]\NOne stinking,\Nmatted raccoon dog
Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.72,0:17:16.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is hardly worth\Nmy precious time.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:16.97,0:17:17.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.93,0:17:21.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Swamp cloud burger!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.17,0:17:24.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A deadly swamp\Nwith the weight of a cloud.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:24.55,0:17:27.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Once touched,\Nnothing can survive!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.55,0:17:28.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DIVINE BAA ]\NWait, no, Gedatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.05,0:17:31.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't aim it at me!\NPlease, stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.41,0:17:38.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NHe can't escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.33,0:17:41.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NI see!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.43,0:17:44.55,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a cloud,\Nso if you try to lift it,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.64,0:17:47.14,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,your hands will just\Npass right through it!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.45,0:17:52.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The more you\Nstruggle to get free,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.04,0:17:56.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the deeper you're\Ndragged inside of it!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.75,0:18:00.92,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NI have to help him!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:01.00,0:18:03.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GEDATSU]\NThere you are, raccoon dog!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.20,0:18:05.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Swamp cloud burger!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.92,0:18:07.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.11,0:18:12.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If one of those things hits me,\NI'll be dead for sure!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:14.90,0:18:17.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you're still alive, hang on!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:19.83,0:18:20.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.19,0:18:23.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You gotta breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.00,0:18:25.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.99,0:18:27.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[coughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.80,0:18:31.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh good, you're alive.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:32.88,0:18:33.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.76,0:18:35.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.68,0:18:39.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GEDATSU]\NHa!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:39.47,0:18:41.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Being saved by the enemy.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.47,0:18:42.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.71,0:18:43.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DIVINE BAA growls]
Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.42,0:18:45.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How dare you, Gedatsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.92,0:18:49.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay!\NI'll never serve you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.09,0:18:50.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GEDATSU]\NHmph!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.46,0:18:53.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Watch, as my axe dial\Ndrains the life from you!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.26,0:18:54.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Haa!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.80,0:18:56.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes. We'll team up.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.22,0:18:57.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And together we'll defeat him.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.77,0:18:58.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.85,0:19:01.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}This one is called\Nmy jet punch!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.46,0:19:16.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GEDATSU]\NThe lethal jet dial.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.09,0:19:18.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Punches accelerated with it\Nallow you to destroy an enemy
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.76,0:19:22.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,before they even realize\Nthe fight has begun.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:23.30,0:19:26.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's only real defect is that\Nit also destroys my clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.94,0:19:29.73,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NThis is a Priest?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.77,0:19:34.69,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,If I don't get out of here right\Nnow, I'll end up like that guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.77,0:19:37.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[shrieks]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.57,0:19:39.28,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NI gotta keep\Nmy feet off the clouds!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:39.38,0:19:41.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those swamp trap\Nthings are everywhere!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.38,0:19:42.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I run on top\Nof the ruins only,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.01,0:19:45.88,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I can make it to the\Nforest and solid ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.80,0:19:50.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.18,0:19:55.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just where do you think you're\Nrunning off to, raccoon?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:55.27,0:19:57.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Here's another jet punch.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.43,0:19:59.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[CHOPPER]\NRumble... jumping point!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.65,0:20:05.78,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NRumble balls\Nlast for three minutes.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.78,0:20:08.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GEDATSU]\NSo, you have Zoan-type powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.12,0:20:09.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.62,0:20:11.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.33,0:20:14.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Too bad. How about another one?!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.26,0:20:14.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.96,0:20:16.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Weight point!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.76,0:20:20.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Swamp cloud burger!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.05,0:20:22.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NThat again?!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.83,0:20:24.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Guard point!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.87,0:20:29.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why that insolent little...!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.51,0:20:30.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[CHOPPER]\NBrain point!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.01,0:20:35.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Rumble Scope! A weak point!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.47,0:20:37.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's got to have\Nsome weak point!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.18,0:20:38.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anything'll do!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:38.27,0:20:40.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I need to find\Na weakness and escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.64,0:20:43.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Jet Punch, contact!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.90,0:20:56.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NEven with\Nmy guard up, it's useless.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.70,0:21:03.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.04,0:21:05.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look, in the clouds above!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:05.75,0:21:07.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can see Giant Jack!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.37,0:21:11.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're close to\Nthe ruins of Shandora!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.59,0:21:15.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eneru's got to be up\Nthere somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.76,0:21:17.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[distant screaming]
Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.93,0:21:28.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NYou called?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.10,0:21:33.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NI'm right here behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.64,0:21:37.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.93,0:21:39.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you want something?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:41.77,0:21:46.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Brave Kamakiri of Shandora.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.24,0:21:48.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eneru, you bastard!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:48.68,0:21:52.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten to\Nwhom you are speaking?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.12,0:21:54.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am God, you know.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.81,0:21:59.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NAnd I know exactly\Nwhat you're thinking, warrior.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:59.19,0:22:02.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're wondering\Nwhy I came down here.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.28,0:22:04.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mantra?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.79,0:22:06.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NI don't need my mantra
Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.33,0:22:08.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to read what's written\Nall over your face!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:09.83,0:22:12.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to read what's written\Nall over your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.42,0:22:15.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:15.46,0:22:17.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I don't blame you.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.38,0:22:19.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Normally,\NI don't bother to fight,
Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.28,0:22:23.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but this time, I'm a player\Nin the Survival Game too.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:23.43,0:22:26.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Besides, I'll be\Nleaving this land soon.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:26.22,0:22:28.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was just saying\Ngood-bye to Gan Fall.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:28.65,0:22:31.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Professional courtesy,\Nyou understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.10,0:22:34.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A game? A game?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:35.07,0:22:37.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I also don't need\Nmy mantra to tell me
Dialogue: 50,0:22:37.13,0:22:40.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that you'd really like\Nto kill me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.56,0:22:43.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NVery well.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:43.40,0:22:46.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I must admit you've shown\Ngreat courage in reaching me,
Dialogue: 50,0:22:46.57,0:22:49.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so I'd say you're\Nentitled to a reward.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:49.34,0:22:53.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Call it a display of God's\Nmercy. Heh, heh.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:53.51,0:22:56.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, then,\NI'll give you five minutes.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:56.89,0:22:59.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For five minutes,\NI won't move a muscle.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:59.82,0:23:00.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KAMAKIRI]\NWhat?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:01.19,0:23:04.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NI won't dodge your\Nattacks, and I won't fight back.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:04.19,0:23:04.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fry me.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:04.90,0:23:05.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Skewer me.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:06.07,0:23:07.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am at your mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.78,0:23:10.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.32,0:23:12.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KAMAKIRI]\NWhy, you!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:12.49,0:23:15.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NBut once\Nthose five minutes are up.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:15.37,0:23:18.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You will know what\Nit means to face God
Dialogue: 50,0:23:18.37,0:23:21.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in the very depths of your soul.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:28.80,0:23:30.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NHis feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.87,0:23:32.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:23:32.62,0:23:35.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the weak spot.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:39.25,0:23:40.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[CHOPPER]\NWalk point!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.19,0:23:45.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NCan I escape?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:45.20,0:23:47.20,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't even see straight.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:48.68,0:23:51.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Still think you can win?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:54.06,0:23:57.06,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NMy legs are shaky at best.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:57.46,0:24:00.84,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,And the rumble ball\Nis about to wear off.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:15.64,0:24:17.94,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NAll right.\NIt's time to stop running.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:20.27,0:24:21.86,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NYou can beat him!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:27.32,0:24:29.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GEDATSU]\NWhat do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:30.68,0:24:32.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Swamp cloud burger!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:34.61,0:24:36.48,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NI'm always\Nthe first to run away,
Dialogue: 50,0:24:36.57,0:24:39.19,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,so everyone thinks\Nthey have to protect me.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:40.82,0:24:44.66,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NThat's why\Nthey can't rely on me.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:44.80,0:24:48.35,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm going to raise\Na pirate flag right here!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:56.94,0:24:58.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you know\Nwhen you've lost?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:59.02,0:25:01.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even the air is\Nmy territory to control.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:01.44,0:25:02.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't escape.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:02.84,0:25:04.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NC'mon.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:14.06,0:25:16.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh no! He took it off.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:16.17,0:25:18.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That raccoon dog took my shoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.91,0:25:21.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So careless!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.70,0:25:28.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, racoon dog
Dialogue: 50,0:25:33.12,0:25:34.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahhh! I'm a monster!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:34.33,0:25:36.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm strong!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:37.29,0:25:40.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]\NThe weakest\Nbeast roars the loudest.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:40.42,0:25:42.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}One last jet punch!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:49.85,0:25:51.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I let myself get carried away
Dialogue: 50,0:25:51.60,0:25:54.02,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,and nearly lost control\Nof my mantra.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:54.81,0:25:56.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NHe only grazed me!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:56.56,0:25:58.48,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.56,0:26:00.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Arm point!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:00.46,0:26:01.50,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm alive!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:02.34,0:26:03.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[CHOPPER]\NMy turn.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:04.60,0:26:06.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Cloven... Cross!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.28,0:26:26.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:26:27.85,0:26:31.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Finally, I'm one\Nof the pirates, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:39.07,0:26:41.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NIt looks like he\Nfell right into a swamp cloud!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:41.70,0:26:44.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good. Now if he\Nwould just stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.37,0:26:46.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You hear me? Don't come up.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:47.04,0:26:49.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just keep on sinking, you jerk!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:50.54,0:26:52.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.92,0:26:53.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams]\NHe's moving!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:57.64,0:26:59.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's still alive.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:59.61,0:27:02.03,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[GEDATSU]\NI can't believe\NI lost to a raccoon dog.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:02.11,0:27:04.36,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Of all the things,\NI could never live down.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:04.45,0:27:06.74,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,And how did I get stuck\Nin my own swamp cloud?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:06.82,0:27:09.41,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,This isn't supposed\Nto happen to me!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:10.99,0:27:14.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[shrieks]\NPlease, oh,\Nplease, just stay down!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.21,0:27:15.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sink! Sink!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.04,0:27:18.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GEDATSU]\NI can escape with a milky dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.59,0:27:23.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow he really sank!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.88,0:27:29.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NDid I? I did. I really beat him!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:34.26,0:27:36.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:37.31,0:27:38.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.15,0:27:47.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NYou've got to stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:49.05,0:27:50.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HOTORI]\NWe won't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.82,0:27:53.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[HOTORI, KOTORI]\N– Ha-ha-hah!\N– Ha-ha-hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.20,0:27:57.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I said stop!\NThey're unconscious!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.25,0:27:58.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HOTORI]\NWe don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.62,0:27:59.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KOTORI]\NWe don't care!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:00.00,0:28:02.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HOTORI]\NThese guys\Nkilled our brother Satori!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:02.41,0:28:03.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KOTORI]\NKilled him!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:03.63,0:28:04.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[HOTORI, KOTORI]\N– They must pay!\N– They must pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.90,0:28:07.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:09.67,0:28:11.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.67,0:28:14.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NAn Impact?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.08,0:28:17.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[farts]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.54,0:28:22.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-hah!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:22.08,0:28:24.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I stored my farts\Nin a Flavor Dial!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.64,0:28:26.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:26.52,0:28:27.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So that's it.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:28.00,0:28:30.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They have four different\Ntypes of Dials they're using,
Dialogue: 50,0:28:30.30,0:28:31.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,instead of just one.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:33.02,0:28:34.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HOTORI]\NHa-ha-hah! That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.26,0:28:35.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Axe! Flame!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.10,0:28:40.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Impact! Flavor! Ha-ha-ha.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:40.31,0:28:42.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You won't be able to keep track!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:42.31,0:28:44.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Which one is Hotori\Nand which one is Kotori?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:44.86,0:28:46.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HOTORI]\NWhat Dial is in which hand?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:46.99,0:28:48.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's so much fun to guess!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:48.61,0:28:50.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\fad(150,150)}[HOTORI, KOTORI]\N– Surprise Dial Illusion!\N– Surprise Dial Illusion!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.51,0:28:52.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha.ha-hah!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:52.59,0:28:53.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL]\NWe know what they have.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:53.80,0:28:55.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no time to waste!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:55.26,0:28:57.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I didn't care which\None of those puffballs
Dialogue: 50,0:28:57.10,0:28:59.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,was which in the first place!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:59.18,0:29:01.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Suck typhoon, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.10,0:29:02.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KOTORI]\NYou missed!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:03.42,0:29:06.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KOTORI]\NGuess which\NDial's in my right hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.51,0:29:11.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha!\NI fooled you! More farts!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:11.77,0:29:16.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha!\NI fooled you! More farts!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:16.45,0:29:18.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Were you expecting flames?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.11,0:29:20.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-hah!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:21.61,0:29:22.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's going to ignite the gas!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:27.92,0:29:29.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.29,0:29:30.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HOTORI]\NHa ha ha-hah!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:31.04,0:29:34.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KOTORI]\NFool! He's been blown away!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.13,0:29:39.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BOTH shriek]
Dialogue: 50,0:29:44.18,0:29:46.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL]\NThat was\Na childishly obvious trick.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:47.43,0:29:50.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you\Nunderestimated me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.69,0:29:53.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HOTORI]\NKotori!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:55.27,0:29:56.78,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NReturn!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.30,0:30:08.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Cyclone Tempo.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.37,0:30:10.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL]\NYou, girl.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:11.12,0:30:14.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Retrieve my gauntlet from the\Nlower deck and finish him off!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:14.16,0:30:14.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NWhat's wrong?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:14.87,0:30:16.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did your wounds open?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:16.08,0:30:16.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL]\NForget me!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:16.83,0:30:18.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He'll be back soon!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:18.46,0:30:19.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NGauntlet?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.33,0:30:22.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gauntlet, gauntlet, gauntlet?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.76,0:30:24.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's a gauntlet?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:26.22,0:30:26.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NOh.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.92,0:30:28.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's heavy!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:28.22,0:30:30.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL]\NIt's made of iron\Nfrom the Blue Sea World.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:30.85,0:30:33.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's an\NImpact Dial inside of it.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:33.10,0:30:34.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Use it as I instructed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.64,0:30:39.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I get the idea, but\NI can barely lift this thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.35,0:30:44.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HOTORI screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:30:44.53,0:30:46.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, there's no time\Nto worry about that now!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:46.85,0:30:48.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,First Satori and then Kotori.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.57,0:30:50.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll pay.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:50.70,0:30:53.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now it's your turn!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:53.20,0:30:54.99,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NHe's the one who uses fire.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:55.08,0:30:58.29,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,He's sopping wet,\Nand the air is full of moisture.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.40,0:31:01.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Cool Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.65,0:31:05.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HOTORI]\NHuh? What's this, just cold air?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:05.13,0:31:06.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.21,0:31:08.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NYep! Cold air, and you use fire!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:08.92,0:31:10.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you mocking me?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:10.79,0:31:12.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you really think\Na little breeze
Dialogue: 50,0:31:12.46,0:31:14.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,can extinguish my Flame Dial?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:14.77,0:31:17.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams]\NI'll burn you to ashes!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:21.36,0:31:24.65,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NThat hot air\Nflowing over the cold air
Dialogue: 50,0:31:24.65,0:31:27.16,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,will cause the moisture\Nin the air to condense!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:27.56,0:31:29.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It'll form a mist!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.49,0:31:32.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Fog Tempo!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:35.20,0:31:36.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HOTORI]\NWhat's this?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:36.15,0:31:37.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's fog everywhere!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:37.96,0:31:39.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't see anything!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:39.59,0:31:41.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.55,0:31:46.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HOTORI]\NWhat?\NWhat is this? What's going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:46.81,0:31:48.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NI beg your pardon!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:48.60,0:31:50.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}And Impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.82,0:31:59.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.52,0:32:02.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Argh! That thing\Nnearly blew my arm off!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:05.31,0:32:08.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you think\Nyou're doing, you old fool!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:08.19,0:32:10.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The pain will pass, my dear,
Dialogue: 50,0:32:10.94,0:32:13.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but I must say, you were superb!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:18.24,0:32:19.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NHey, yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:19.87,0:32:22.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I protected the ship\Nand the crew!
